<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Grant us, Lord, a willing spirit.</l><l>To build Your Body we would strive.</l><l>By our measure we would function,</l><l>Until full grown we’d all arrive.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>As the members of His Body,</l><l>Each one is now a life supply.</l><l>Serving Christ to one another,</l><l>In love, His Body built thereby.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
